\b\fs36\cf1 Contents (Dual Joystick)
\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par A se{\up K}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up K} Principal Operation}
t of 2 joysticks move the stage. The current position is indicated in the readout window of the Dual Joystick Stage Controller.
\par 
\par The speed is adjusted according to magnification (magnification compensation).
\par 
\par 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx7935\cellx13255\pard\intbl The Dual Joystick Stage Controller is a self contained part similar to the key board and placed conveniently on the desk of the electronic console.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl Two joysticks are provided which control the stage movements. The position of the stage is indicated in a window above the joysticks.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \b X/Y travels \plain\fs24 are controlled from the bigger joystick on the left in up/down and left/right direction respectively.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \b Rotation \plain\fs24 is controlled by turning the bigger joystick left or right.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \b Z travel \plain\fs24 is controlled with the smaller joystick to the right in up/down direction.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \b Tilt\plain\fs24  is controlled with the smaller joystick in left/right direction.\cell\pard \pard\intbl  
\par\intbl            \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\cell\intbl\row
\pard 
\par For further information see \uldb \b Operating Instructions\plain\b\fs24 {\v Operating_Instructions} \plain\fs24 
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Moving the Stage}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Moving_the_Stage}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 Moving the Stage
\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx5665\cellx13255\pard\intbl\li355\fi-355\tx355 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\tab \b X/Y:\plain\fs24  When you shift the big joystick (1) on the left horizontally and vertically the stage moves horizontally and vertically in that particular direction. The more you move the joystick away from the centre the faster the stage moves. 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\tab \b Z:\plain\fs24  When you shift forward or draw back the small joystick (3) on the right the stage moves in the Z direction. The more you move the joystick away from the centre the faster the stage moves.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\tab \b R:\plain\fs24  When you turn the big joystick (1) left or right  the stage rotates in that particular direction. The more you turn the joystick away from the centre  the faster the stage rotates.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\tab \b T:\plain\fs24  When you shift left or right the small joystick (3) the stage tilts. The more you move the joystick away from the centre the faster the stage tilts. Only applicable if the tilt axis is motorised\cell\pard \pard\intbl\li355\fi-355\tx355 \pard\intbl      \{bmc bm2.wmf\}\cell\intbl\row
\pard 
\par \page
